          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "What it may include"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Conversation and practice, woven."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "One session may be primarily reflective. Another may involve movement or embodied inquiry. Another may involve mapping patterns. Another may become ritual. Another may involve creative practice, relationship inquiry, meditation, nature connection or tangible restructuring of your life."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Between sessions there can be personalized practices such as writing prompts, rituals, meditation, movement, observation or experiments in everyday life."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
