              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The principle beneath it"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "True Nature Alignment"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Coming into relationship with one's essential nature and building a life in deeper correspondence with it. The Thread is how that practice becomes personal: we find the living thread and follow it."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
